  "description": {
    "text": "Basic Energy cards with a ©2006 line and no set symbol or collection number, in the same six types and EX-era painting as the 2005 Energies. Plain copies came in theme decks: collectors found them in the decks of EX Legend Maker and EX Holon Phantoms, while the EX Crystal Guardians, Dragon Frontiers and Power Keepers decks that followed carried ©2005 Energy again.\n\nHolo copies of the six were given to players in the 2006-2007 Pokémon League cycle."
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "No set symbol or number, and a ©2006 line"
